# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Never commit real values.

# Key from a dedicated OpenAI project with a hard spend limit.
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Signs visitor sessions: at least 32 random characters. Generate one with
# node -e "console.log(require('node:crypto').randomBytes(32).toString('base64url'))"
CHAT_SECRET=

# A current OpenAI model your project may use. Set it wherever the app builds or runs.
ASKDARE_MODEL=gpt-6.1-terra

# Optional: replace the bot's defaults in askdare.config.ts.
# ASKDARE_INSTRUCTIONS=You answer questions about our product. If you do not know, say so.
# ASKDARE_GREETING=Hi! How can I help?
# Other sites that may embed the chat, comma-separated.
# ASKDARE_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://www.example.com
